# Code Owners

This file defines who owns what parts of the codebase.

For more information, see [GitHub Docs — About code owners](https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-details/customizing-your-repository-about-code-owners).

## Default Owner

| Pattern | Owner |
|---------|-------|
| `*` | @Carme99 |

All files default to @Carme99 as the code owner. PRs will request review from this account.
